{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00425",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 4.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.7,
      "end_seconds": 8.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "No trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 9.93,
      "end_seconds": 13.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.26,
      "end_seconds": 17.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.98,
      "end_seconds": 22.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "So, I've been getting breathless walking short distances, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.5,
      "end_seconds": 28.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.41,
      "end_seconds": 30.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.03,
      "end_seconds": 34.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.29,
      "end_seconds": 45.87,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "Stopping to rest helps a bit. Severe, I'd say. I'd say a few times a day. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.81,
      "end_seconds": 49.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.48,
      "end_seconds": 62.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.13,
      "text": "A feeling that I can't take a deep breath goes along with it, most of the time. The feeling that I can't take a deep breath? That's been for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.63,
      "end_seconds": 65.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.81,
      "end_seconds": 73.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. There's tiredness as well. I've had occasional wheeze too, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.79,
      "end_seconds": 78.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.66,
      "end_seconds": 84.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.78,
      "end_seconds": 88.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Any chest pain, coughing up blood or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.64,
      "end_seconds": 93.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.39,
      "end_seconds": 97.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss, fever or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.44,
      "end_seconds": 102.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss, fever or night sweats, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.97,
      "end_seconds": 107.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.59,
      "end_seconds": 110.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.83,
      "end_seconds": 113.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.32,
      "end_seconds": 118.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.48,
      "end_seconds": 121.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.15,
      "end_seconds": 126.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I'm on ramipril, 5 milligrams, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.74,
      "end_seconds": 131.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.09,
      "end_seconds": 137.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "No, it's at home. Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.73,
      "end_seconds": 142.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.11,
      "end_seconds": 144.01,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.31,
      "end_seconds": 160.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any allergies I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.16,
      "end_seconds": 170.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Yes, peanuts. I get my lips swelling. I'm allergic to latex, I get a rash on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.02,
      "end_seconds": 173.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Alright, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.3,
      "end_seconds": 175.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.17,
      "end_seconds": 193.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.55,
      "end_seconds": 200.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for nearly five years. Well, I've had COPD, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.84,
      "end_seconds": 220.51,
      "duration_seconds": 18.67,
      "text": "Okay, COPD, that's already on your record. Good to know. It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.46,
      "end_seconds": 223.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.97,
      "end_seconds": 227.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.42,
      "end_seconds": 229.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.68,
      "end_seconds": 244.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.74,
      "end_seconds": 248.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.71,
      "end_seconds": 249.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.22,
      "end_seconds": 252.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.36,
      "end_seconds": 273.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.69,
      "end_seconds": 275.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.39,
      "end_seconds": 278.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Can you lie back for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.54,
      "end_seconds": 298.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.39,
      "end_seconds": 316.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "text": "So, all done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.81,
      "end_seconds": 328.94,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.3,
      "end_seconds": 345.36,
      "duration_seconds": 15.06,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be heart-related breathlessness, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.78,
      "end_seconds": 349.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.9,
      "end_seconds": 369.02,
      "duration_seconds": 19.12,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been getting breathless walking short distances for about a month, severe, and no chest pain or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.79,
      "end_seconds": 371.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.7,
      "end_seconds": 375.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.69,
      "end_seconds": 389.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Yes, um, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.88,
      "end_seconds": 412.34,
      "duration_seconds": 22.46,
      "text": "I'm going to order a CT scan of the chest, for chronic breathlessness. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for chronic breathlessness. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.22,
      "end_seconds": 428.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.62,
      "end_seconds": 429.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.08,
      "end_seconds": 437.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.94,
      "end_seconds": 440.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.66,
      "end_seconds": 444.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.29,
      "end_seconds": 446.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.43,
      "end_seconds": 454.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 455.33,
      "end_seconds": 460.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 460.95,
      "end_seconds": 466.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 466.37,
      "end_seconds": 469.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "So, thank you. I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 469.84,
      "end_seconds": 471.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}